<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="main" class="account-page" data-settings-page><div class="account-page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</span><h1>Settings</h1><p>Preferences are saved on this device and apply immediately.</p></div><nav class="account-tabs" aria-label="Account"><a href="/profile">Profile</a><a href="/settings" aria-current="page">Settings</a></nav><div class="settings-layout"><section class="panel account-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Appearance & accessibility</h2></div><div class="setting-body"><fieldset class="setting-group"><legend>Theme</legend><p>Use a fixed theme or follow your device setting.</p><div class="setting-options" data-setting-theme><label><input type="radio" name="setting-theme" value="light"><span>Light</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="setting-theme" value="dark"><span>Dark</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="setting-theme" value="system"><span>Device</span></label></div></fieldset><fieldset class="setting-group"><legend>Animations</legend><p>Reduce motion for a quieter experience, including map movement.</p><div class="setting-options"><label><input type="radio" name="setting-motion" value="system"><span>Follow device</span></label><label><input type="radio" name="setting-motion" value="reduce"><span>Reduce motion</span></label></div></fieldset><div class="setting-row"><div><label for="setting-return">Return to my workspace</label><p>Skip the welcome page when you return to the site.</p></div><input id="setting-return" type="checkbox" class="preference-checkbox" role="switch"></div></div></section><section class="panel account-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Map & saved preferences</h2></div><div class="setting-body"><div class="setting-summary"><h3>Map starting view</h3><strong>Nigeria</strong><p>The map opens on Nigeria. A selected bus or route can move the map to its actual position.</p><a href="/student#tracking" class="text-button">Open map <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a></div><div class="setting-group"><h3>Saved bus & pickup stop</h3><p>Clear the selection remembered in this browser tab.</p><button class="btn btn-outline" type="button" data-clear-pickup>Clear pickup selection</button></div><div class="setting-group"><h3>Reset device preferences</h3><p>Restore device theme and motion settings, clear the saved workspace and pickup selection. Your demo profile is kept.</p><button class="text-button" type="button" data-reset-preferences>Reset preferences</button></div></div></section><section class="panel account-panel settings-session"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Session</h2></div><div class="setting-body"><p data-settings-session>You're browsing as a guest.</p><div class="form-actions"><a href="/profile" class="btn btn-outline">Manage profile</a><a href="/signin" class="text-button" data-settings-signin>Sign in</a><button class="text-button" type="button" data-signout hidden>Sign out</button></div><p class="account-fine-print">Sign-out clears the demo identity, returning-workspace preference and saved pickup for this tab. Appearance preferences remain on this device.</p></div></section></div><p class="form-status settings-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-settings-status></p></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
